        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86082-86078, Wilshire Pull with 12 x 3 Knoxville Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wilshire Door Pull with Knoxville Pull Plate has a traditional look that makes it a great choice for classically  decorated homes and commercial buildings. This Wilshire Pull with 12 x 3 Knoxville Pull Plate Set is available in several beautiful finishes and comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/12-x-3-knoxville-push-plate-emtek-86081\"><b> Knoxville Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Emtek Knoxville Pull Plate with Wilshire Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Base: 1-1/8\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with (1) door pull, (1) pull plate, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86082-86078-specifications.pdf?v=1704262359\"><b>Emtek 86082-86078 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
